[{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b003:l010","ordinal":266753,"en":"It seemed he demanded my very life."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b003:l011","ordinal":266754,"en":"Each of them thrust a spear at me"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b003:l012","ordinal":266755,"en":"Until my head reeled."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b003:l013","ordinal":266756,"en":"They blocked and barred my road;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b003:l014","ordinal":266757,"en":"Your kinsman set me aflame,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b003:l015","ordinal":266758,"en":"And this cousin of yours showed me wonders."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b003:l016","ordinal":266759,"en":"If I fell into the hands of your Kazakhs,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b003:l017","ordinal":266760,"en":"They would ignore my pleas;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b003:l018","ordinal":266761,"en":"Such was their savage frenzy,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b003:l019","ordinal":266762,"en":"They meant to gouge out my eyes."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b003:l020","ordinal":266763,"en":"They meant to bring my age to an end,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b003:l021","ordinal":266764,"en":"Simply to crush the life from my body."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b003:l022","ordinal":266765,"en":"When the bay horse travels far,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b003:l023","ordinal":266766,"en":"It shows no sign of being a true racer;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b003:l024","ordinal":266767,"en":"When this cousin camps in your village,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b003:l025","ordinal":266768,"en":"He shows no sign of being kin."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b003:l026","ordinal":266769,"en":"Frightened and skittish, the accursed man"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b003:l027","ordinal":266770,"en":"May camp as your neighbor today,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b003:l028","ordinal":266771,"en":"But if this cousin finds an opening,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b003:l029","ordinal":266772,"en":"He may become your enemy tomorrow."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b003:l030","ordinal":266773,"en":"If he camps beside you,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b003:l031","ordinal":266774,"en":"He may devour your beloved foal,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b003:l032","ordinal":266775,"en":"Open the mouth of your treasury,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b003:l033","ordinal":266776,"en":"And scatter your countless troops."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b003:l034","ordinal":266777,"en":"Should some desperate affair arise,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b003:l035","ordinal":266778,"en":"He may betray your secrets to the enemy."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b003:l036","ordinal":266779,"en":"He will listen closely to your words"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b003:l037","ordinal":266780,"en":"And then deceive you."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b003:l038","ordinal":266781,"en":"If a mace should fall into his hand,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b003:l039","ordinal":266782,"en":"He would gouge out your eyes."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l001","ordinal":266783,"en":"A hollow can never be firm ground;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l002","ordinal":266784,"en":"This Ümötöy is a worthless fellow—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l003","ordinal":266785,"en":"A hero who stirs turmoil can never make a nation."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l004","ordinal":266786,"en":"A riverbank is no mountain ridge;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l005","ordinal":266787,"en":"This dear cousin of yours is no true people."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l006","ordinal":266788,"en":"Your courage is great, but you have no sense;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l007","ordinal":266789,"en":"You have always been a heedless soul."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l008","ordinal":266790,"en":"Your greatness is abundant, but wisdom is lacking;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l009","ordinal":266791,"en":"Hero, you have been a vain and reckless khan."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l010","ordinal":266792,"en":"You were always the reckless one"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l011","ordinal":266793,"en":"Who acted the instant you faced a matter;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l012","ordinal":266794,"en":"Time after time,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l013","ordinal":266795,"en":"I was the one who suffered for you."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l014","ordinal":266796,"en":"You have heard my words; now heed them."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l015","ordinal":266797,"en":"Hero, if your heart so wishes,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l016","ordinal":266798,"en":"Accept your cousin as kin."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l017","ordinal":266799,"en":"Hero, unless you deem him too violent,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l018","ordinal":266800,"en":"Heed the words of your warrior."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l019","ordinal":266801,"en":"Hero, if you will not heed your warrior,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l020","ordinal":266802,"en":"Then heed the words"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l021","ordinal":266803,"en":"Of your elder kinsman Ümötöy."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l022","ordinal":266804,"en":"Agree to what he asks:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l023","ordinal":266805,"en":"Drive six thousand head, led by horses,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l024","ordinal":266806,"en":"Loaded with gold,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l025","ordinal":266807,"en":"And prepare six thousand men"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l026","ordinal":266808,"en":"To drive those horses there;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l027","ordinal":266809,"en":"Consent to his demand."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l028","ordinal":266810,"en":"Your father slew his father;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l029","ordinal":266811,"en":"Without quarreling or feuding,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l030","ordinal":266812,"en":"He has demanded blood-price—pay it!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l031","ordinal":266813,"en":"With their forward saddles sagging,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l032","ordinal":266814,"en":"Their two humps towering,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l033","ordinal":266815,"en":"Their necks held high like ducks,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l034","ordinal":266816,"en":"Drive seven thousand red camels"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l035","ordinal":266817,"en":"With every tail braided."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l036","ordinal":266818,"en":"Load them with measures of gold and jewels,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l037","ordinal":266819,"en":"Say, ‘This is your father’s blood-price,’"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l038","ordinal":266820,"en":"And give them to Ümötöy."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1054:b004:l039","ordinal":266821,"en":"If you will not agree to these words,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l001","ordinal":266822,"en":"If you don't give this,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l002","ordinal":266823,"en":"I don't like what you said,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l003","ordinal":266824,"en":"After all, this part"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l004","ordinal":266825,"en":"You will be your enemy."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l005","ordinal":266826,"en":"Call Sary-Arka and take the road"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l006","ordinal":266827,"en":"Yellow-backed"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l007","ordinal":266828,"en":"Driving from Kazak"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l008","ordinal":266829,"en":"The place you came to dig,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l009","ordinal":266830,"en":"The broth that comes out of the kettle."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l010","ordinal":266831,"en":"Please call and see you,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l011","ordinal":266832,"en":"When we went to Beijing"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l012","ordinal":266833,"en":"Bad letter, young boy"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l013","ordinal":266834,"en":"Total destruction,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l014","ordinal":266835,"en":"Umotai, the soul of the soul"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l015","ordinal":266836,"en":"Nice to do,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l016","ordinal":266837,"en":"Draw Talas land,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l017","ordinal":266838,"en":"Destroy your people,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l018","ordinal":266839,"en":"You made the people yellow,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l019","ordinal":266840,"en":"Wait until the end,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l020","ordinal":266841,"en":"It seems that there was a spill"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l021","ordinal":266842,"en":"See your blood as black as a spoon."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l022","ordinal":266843,"en":"Yellow blood, watch your blood,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l023","ordinal":266844,"en":"Umotay found the cut"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l024","ordinal":266845,"en":"All of you who are scumbags."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l025","ordinal":266846,"en":"A slave from Sary-Arka"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l026","ordinal":266847,"en":"He is scolded in various ways"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l027","ordinal":266848,"en":"Umotoy is the leader of Kolgo"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l028","ordinal":266849,"en":"Birth looks like this."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l029","ordinal":266850,"en":"I made the right choice,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l030","ordinal":266851,"en":"Take a bite."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l031","ordinal":266852,"en":"If you call it a dirty word, it's Choronu"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l032","ordinal":266853,"en":"Give birth, now kill."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l033","ordinal":266854,"en":"Umotoy, son of Kokcha"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l034","ordinal":266855,"en":"It looks like an enemy, it looks like hair,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l035","ordinal":266856,"en":"That's right, it seems."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l036","ordinal":266857,"en":"It looks like a black mountain."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l037","ordinal":266858,"en":"They went against each other,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l038","ordinal":266859,"en":"This is worse than staying"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b003:l039","ordinal":266860,"en":"it seems."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l001","ordinal":266861,"en":"If it comes to Umotai"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l002","ordinal":266862,"en":"It's like finding a wife and planting a village."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l003","ordinal":266863,"en":"As if to suck,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l004","ordinal":266864,"en":"It's like being an old enemy."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l005","ordinal":266865,"en":"Get used to it,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l006","ordinal":266866,"en":"Give whatever you want."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l007","ordinal":266867,"en":"If you call it a wandering slave,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l008","ordinal":266868,"en":"If you say that the slave is a gossip boy"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l009","ordinal":266869,"en":"Give your brother a night now,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l010","ordinal":266870,"en":"Kokjalym, the right enemy is this,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l011","ordinal":266871,"en":"Listen to what he said!\""},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l012","ordinal":266872,"en":"That's how Kulchoro said,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l013","ordinal":266873,"en":"This is the hero Umutay,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l014","ordinal":266874,"en":"Burned infidel"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l015","ordinal":266875,"en":"If the moon is shining a lot,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l016","ordinal":266876,"en":"There is a problem,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l017","ordinal":266877,"en":"This is the one that caught fire"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l018","ordinal":266878,"en":"If it sticks, it won't die"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l019","ordinal":266879,"en":"There is boredom."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l020","ordinal":266880,"en":"Active when facing,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l021","ordinal":266881,"en":"There is a gift."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l022","ordinal":266882,"en":"If the face does not speak,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l023","ordinal":266883,"en":"There is a problem with this."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l024","ordinal":266884,"en":"If you melt it,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l025","ordinal":266885,"en":"Make it a relative."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l026","ordinal":266886,"en":"If you don't get used to it,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l027","ordinal":266887,"en":"Barely put this on the road."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l028","ordinal":266888,"en":"At the bottom you will see"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l029","ordinal":266889,"en":"If you count people, it is at the bottom"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l030","ordinal":266890,"en":"Kokzhalym, you will die from Umotoy."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l031","ordinal":266891,"en":"This is Umutay kafir,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l032","ordinal":266892,"en":"Angry hero"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l033","ordinal":266893,"en":"If you have a lot of money,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l034","ordinal":266894,"en":"When you go to the ground,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l035","ordinal":266895,"en":"When you bleed,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l036","ordinal":266896,"en":"When you get fat and fresh tomorrow"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l037","ordinal":266897,"en":"When landing along Sary-Arka,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l038","ordinal":266898,"en":"His life shines like grass,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1055:b004:l039","ordinal":266899,"en":"When you are satisfied with this"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1056:b003:l001","ordinal":266900,"en":"Landing along Sary-Arka,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1056:b003:l002","ordinal":266901,"en":"Umotay holding a watch"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p10